N: in Vickers under the title "the Cream Pot -or- the Kern Staff" (thanks, John Adams)
N:the actual ending in Gow book is (eg bars 5/6 if A part) "e2C Ceg | f2d d2c". I think this version is how I learnt it from Simon Booth (melodeon), or it may be that I've fiddled it to suit the range of my clarinet.
