C:e. Bengt Jakobsson
M:3/4
N:He was a Danish concert pianist who moved to Norway to study beavers and became
N:a ski-jumper. Now plays accordion, leads Røros spelmanslag
N:In point of fact, the recording this comes from has slight, but
N: consistent, differences of rhythm and ornament between the 1st time
N: through the A music and the repeat, this is a combination of the 2.
