A:Jämtland
L:1/8
M:4/4
N:NEW
N:Helpful people will point out that my attribution of "Jämtland", which is
N: in the middle of Sweden, makes no sense for a tune from Rumania. That's
N: the way it is, honest. I have it from Lasse Sörlin of Östersund, who had
N: it from Rumanians who live there.
