N:strong resemblance in the MS of  John Miller of Perth, 1799..and the
N: version in Vicker's MS... photocopy
N:very unclear Do I hear faint echoes of 'Off she goes' - 'Pop goes the
N:Weasel'..  Edited with reference to version in John Miller, Perth MS
N:1799..CGr.
Z:vmp.C.Graebe.
