X:1
T:the Old Pipe Reel
M:4/4
N:Found via JC, at http://trillian.mit.edu/~jc/music/abc/mirror/home.quicknet.nl/england.abc
N:which doesn't seem to exist any more.
N:I'd always (only) heard this as a 2-part tune in Scots contexts, but this
N:one has a bit more to it (it _is_ credited to England, it's not a misprint).
N:I have no source for it other than the defunct link.
N: <a href=/tune/2093>See also</a>
